  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "work_hours_per_workday": {
      "type": "number",
      "exclusiveMinimum": 0
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "work_hours_per_workday"
  ]
}

So I will return:
{
  "work_hours_per_workday": 8
}

No other text, just valid JSON.

